    "body": "unique_id is a String(50) column in the Participant table.\r\n\r\nToday this caused an error as a request to create a participant was received with a unique_id of u'A0384[redacted 16 characters]:3YOH7BII097S091VIWGYDU7IGJLVKI'. This is 55 chars long and so it wouldn't fit in the table.\r\n\r\nIt is trivial to allow longer strings in the table, but do we want to do this? I thought worker/assignment ids were of fixed length, in which case this probably indicates an error somewhere.\r\n\r\nWhat do we think?",
